  "changelog": "Tailwind CSS language server package 0.1.0\n\nMinimum Cadencr application version: 0.16.1. This release publishes package assets only. Production marketplace catalog admission, the LSP revocation feed and the desktop release remain separate rollout steps.\n\nCanonical archive and runtime qualification: https://github.com/merkr-software/CadencR/actions/runs/42215738947\n\nRequires an existing Node.js >= 20.0.0. Qualification used Node.js 22.19.0; upstream supported-major restrictions still apply. Cadencr does not install Node.js or resolve project dependencies. The project must supply Tailwind CSS dependencies and configuration; they are not installed by this language-server package.\n\n<!-- cadencr-publication-binding:sha256:043d7a29aaa388f4873fc887710aff04d72fc4980f3815910ba40dfb86b5db96 -->"
